<title>USA: United Foods closes buyback tender.</title>
<headline>United Foods closes buyback tender.</headline>
<dateline>BELLS, Tenn. 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Foods Inc said it closed its tender offer to buy back 2.5 million shares of its Class A common stock and 1.5 million shares of its Class B common stock on July 3.</p>
<p>The company said about 2.64 million shares of the Class A common and 1.72 shares of the Class B common were tendered, according to preliminary results.</p>
<p>The company said it started the buyback May 30.</p>
</text>
